    title: Megaproject mastery
    description: Complete stage three of any one megaproject.
    metric: 8
    target: 3
    route: 1
  - id: era_foothold
    title: Foothold
    description: Reach the Foothold era by landing on a second world.
    metric: 9
    target: 1
    route: 2
